  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marie Stopes MDG 5</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Marie Stopes MDG 5</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase the opportunities for women and young people to exercise their sexual and reproductive health rights, thereby contributing to MDG 5 in Zambia (reduction in maternal mortality and universal access to reproductive health).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marie Stopes Zambia is a locally registered non-profit organization working to inform Zambians about SRHR and to provide comprehensive SRHR service. There is an unmet need for these services that the Zambian Government has not been able to meet. Marie Stopes could therefore support and complement the efforts done by the Zambian government to meet MDG 5. The organization is innovative in its methods to reach out to the rural population and have a track record of being able to provide tangible results.

The result strategy for development cooperation with Zambia (2013-2017) has improved health as a result area and one of the results under the result area is &#x201c;Increased awareness of and access to sexual and reproductive health services and the rights for girls and boys&#x201d;. Marie Stopes work is in line with the strategy and the specific SRHR result and also complements already decided Swedish interventions as their focus is more on SRHR services. MSZ is also special as it provides with a broader spectrum of services including safe abortion. The organization covers a large part of Zambia which few organizations do. Marie Stopes programme is considered relevant for Swedish priorities and results.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Marie Stopes Zambia &#xe4;r en lokalt registrerad icke vinstgivande ideell organisation som arbetar f&#xf6;r att informera zambier kring sexuell och reproduktiv h&#xe4;lsa och r&#xe4;ttigheter (SRHR) och f&#xf6;rse landet med SRHR tj&#xe4;nster. Det finns ett icke tillgodosett behov av dessa tj&#xe4;nster som den zambiska regeringen inte har kunnat tillfredst&#xe4;lla. Marie Stopes kan d&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r st&#xf6;dja och komplettera de insatser som g&#xf6;rs av den zambiska regeringen att uppfylla millenniem&#xe5;let nummer 5. Organisationen &#xe4;r innovativ i sina metoder att n&#xe5; ut till befolkningen p&#xe5; landsbygden och har en historia av att leverera konkreta resultat.</narrative>
  </description>
